# ProjMan2 monorepo — root ignore.
# Per-stack ignores also apply: app/.gitignore (Flutter), server/api/.gitignore (Node).
# The patterns below are belt-and-braces so a secret or build artifact can never
# slip in from a path a sub-ignore doesn't cover (development.md §9 — the legacy
# repo leaked live credentials; that must never be repeated here).

# ── Secrets — never commit ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks
# Firebase / Google client config — carries API keys (AIza…) GitHub secret-scanning
# flags. Client-side config, but keep it out of the repo; supply locally / via CI.
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
# .env.example templates are intentionally NOT ignored.

# ── Dependencies & build artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules/
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/.next/
**/.turbo/

# ── Local tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── OS / editor ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.log
*.swp
.idea/
